  "id": "dynamical/asos-parquet",
  "title": "Global Airport Weather GeoParquet (1940-present)",
  "description": "A global archive of decoded METAR surface weather observations from ASOS and AWOS airport stations, spanning 1940 to present with roughly 1.8 billion records. Each observation includes temperature, dewpoint, wind, precipitation, visibility, and pressure in both imperial and metric units, with per-record station point geometry, partitioned by year as GeoParquet.",
